  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Prospects-P10009349-002</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FMO proposes to invest up to EUR 5m (consisting of EUR 2.5m, with an option for a EUR 500k top-up) through a convertible note and EUR 2.5m mezzanine. FMO investee Energy Access Ventures Fund (&#x201c;EAVF&#x201d; or the &#x201c;Fund&#x201d;), has invested EUR 4.5m in the Company&#x2019;s previous round through EUR 1.5m in equity and EUR 3m in Mezzanine.</narrative>
  </description>
